  "_about": "R1 expectations (current-release recheck), committed before any run. Release v1.9.1 (16 Nov 2026, build tag gmrtd_sweep_authentic), the latest gmrtd release; v1.7.1 was the last release measured (U1). Prediction from the source diff v1.7.1...v1.9.1: no cell changes. The changes are CMS verification (RFC 6211 CMSAlgorithmProtection, verified only when present), MRZ parsing of spaces, the NL CSCA master list, a nil check on the Chip Authentication public key's KeyId in selectCAPubKeyInfo (our CA keys carry a KeyId or the CA info names none), a test-only SequenceTransceiver, and CI. PACE, BAC, the CA and AA error handling and RequireAuthenticDocument are unchanged. So E1 to E12 hold as in U1, and the BAC cells (B1 to B4, D11) hold as for v1.3.2 in suites u7-bac and u7b-bac. Checks as in U1, plus not_applicable = classifier outcome. Positive controls: E1, E2, E5, E11.",
